  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO&#x2019;s support to Pacific EBMOs at the sub-regional level aims to achieve economies of scale by customizing tested global approaches in the above areas, enabling cost-effective replicable solutions and knowledge-sharing. Technical assistance and collaboration with the Pacific Island Private Sector Organization (PIPSO) is a key focus of work this biennium, with support extended to assist in review of constituion and bylaws; regional consultations with private sector on labour moblity and production of associatd policy recommendations; and collaboration on research into resiliancy in small island developing states, including a joint event to launch the research.</narrative>
  </description>
